WEBVTT

00:15.932 --> 00:17.934
[opening theme music playing]

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:45.045 --> 00:47.922
[tense music playing]

00:48.882 --> 00:50.049
[Jang Uk] Bu-yeon and I are married.

00:50.884 --> 00:53.386
So please, give us your blessings.

00:53.470 --> 00:55.388
How can you get married
without my permission?

00:55.972 --> 00:59.309
Jang Uk, I have no intention
of handing my daughter over to you.

00:59.392 --> 01:01.269
Does it look like
I'm asking for your permission here?

01:02.062 --> 01:03.146
As I said,

01:03.980 --> 01:05.398
the two of us are already married.

01:09.360 --> 01:10.236
Bu-yeon.

01:11.529 --> 01:12.530
Answer me, my dear.

01:13.364 --> 01:14.199
Is it true?

01:14.783 --> 01:16.117
My sweet daughter

01:16.201 --> 01:19.037
would never deceive her mother
by marrying a man like him,

01:20.330 --> 01:21.331
would you?

01:22.916 --> 01:24.667
Mother, how could I ever abandon you?

01:25.376 --> 01:27.253
Yes. You wouldn't.

01:27.337 --> 01:29.589
[Ho-gyeong] Not my precious daughter!

01:31.466 --> 01:32.300
But I'm sorry.

01:34.302 --> 01:36.429
I cannot continue to live
the way you wish me to, Mother.

01:37.972 --> 01:39.599
And that's why I married this man.

01:40.975 --> 01:41.810
So now…

01:44.270 --> 01:45.188
we will live together.

01:45.271 --> 01:46.523
I don't believe it.

01:47.482 --> 01:48.441
My daughter is lying,

01:48.525 --> 01:50.610
Jang Uk is forcing her
to do this against her will.

01:51.444 --> 01:52.821
Their marriage must be a lie!

01:52.904 --> 01:55.907
Are you going to sit there and watch?
Will you do nothing?

01:56.699 --> 01:57.534
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon clears throat]

01:58.201 --> 02:01.538
[suspenseful music playing]

02:01.621 --> 02:02.789
[clears throat]

02:06.417 --> 02:07.877
[male mage clears throat]

02:14.467 --> 02:15.301
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon] Jang Uk.

02:16.553 --> 02:19.097
Did you not swear
in front of this Assembly

02:19.180 --> 02:22.642
on the life of Park Jin
that you would never abuse your powers.

02:23.226 --> 02:25.019
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon]
How dare you marry the heir of Jinyowon

02:25.103 --> 02:26.646
without asking for proper permission!

02:27.230 --> 02:28.898
Leave Jin Bu-yeon and go now.

02:29.482 --> 02:32.235
If you do not drop this claim
and leave right this instant,

02:32.318 --> 02:34.195
Park Jin will bear
the price of your action.

02:34.279 --> 02:36.281
I haven't had to use any of my powers yet.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.158
Are you so afraid of me

02:38.241 --> 02:39.993
that you have to use his life
to threaten me?

02:40.076 --> 02:42.412
[scoffs]
Afraid of you?

02:42.495 --> 02:43.997
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon laughs]

02:44.664 --> 02:47.917
It seems that you fear nothing,
not when you have that power,

02:48.001 --> 02:49.586
but this is the Unanimous Assembly.

02:49.669 --> 02:51.629
We cannot be frightened
by someone like you.

02:51.713 --> 02:52.547
Okay, then…

02:53.506 --> 02:55.008
please be sure you're watching me

02:56.009 --> 02:58.511
as I take this woman
out of this place with me.

03:00.930 --> 03:03.308
[intense music playing]

03:11.149 --> 03:13.109
Being the leader is one thing,
but why do I have to take

03:13.192 --> 03:15.111
my uncle's seat at the Unanimous Assembly?

03:15.653 --> 03:17.780
We should hurry. It seems
the Unanimous Assembly has begun.

03:17.864 --> 03:18.698
Yes.

03:31.753 --> 03:35.423
I heard you're now the acting leader.
So of course you have to be here.

03:36.299 --> 03:37.634
So you came too, Young Lady Jin.

03:38.593 --> 03:41.221
Uh, I heard
that your sister was found safe

03:41.304 --> 03:42.972
and that she'll be announced
as the heir tonight.

03:43.056 --> 03:46.517
I heard that you were the one
who shared her portrait all over Daeho.

03:46.601 --> 03:49.062
Yeah, well, that was no trouble at all.

03:49.145 --> 03:50.647
Especially since it was your sister.

03:50.730 --> 03:52.774
I had to do whatever I could to help you.

03:52.857 --> 03:55.026
Why did you do it
when no one asked you to?

03:55.610 --> 03:59.197
Now that everyone knows her face,
she will have to be locked away forever.

04:01.491 --> 04:02.659
Poor thing.

04:03.618 --> 04:05.536
Uh, what? Locked away?

04:06.663 --> 04:08.414
[tense music playing]

04:15.463 --> 04:17.131
[Sang-ho] Something must have happened
during the meeting.

04:24.514 --> 04:25.598
[sharp blast]

04:28.226 --> 04:30.061
[all exclaim]

04:30.728 --> 04:32.313
[all murmuring]

04:32.397 --> 04:33.356
[male mage whispers]
Did you see that?

04:33.439 --> 04:35.858
He unleashed such power
without even drawing his sword.

04:35.942 --> 04:37.777
It's the energy of the ice stone.

04:38.736 --> 04:41.781
If Jang Uk wanted to,
he could use that power

04:41.864 --> 04:44.242
- to take every soul gathered here.
- [Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon] Regardless,

04:44.325 --> 04:46.452
among us are the finest mages of Daeho!

04:46.536 --> 04:48.454
If we allow him to go,
what will that make us?

04:48.538 --> 04:50.331
Everyone, please remain calm.

04:54.752 --> 04:56.671
One side here doesn't believe
they're married,

04:56.754 --> 04:59.048
while the other claims
they've already wed.

04:59.799 --> 05:01.134
So then how about this?

05:01.217 --> 05:03.970
Bring forth a witness
who can verify you two are married.

05:04.053 --> 05:05.054
Why do you need a witness

05:05.138 --> 05:06.723
when the married couple
stand before you now?

05:07.974 --> 05:09.559
Because no one believes you.

05:09.642 --> 05:12.228
If you two can produce
a witness to verify your marriage,

05:12.312 --> 05:13.563
then you'll have our blessings.

05:13.646 --> 05:15.023
But if you can't,

05:15.106 --> 05:17.984
Jang Uk, you have no right
to take the heir of Jinyowon,

05:18.693 --> 05:19.861
and you'll have to go alone.

05:19.944 --> 05:21.029
[scoffs]

05:21.988 --> 05:24.449
As always, I see
you're picking fights over justification.

05:28.369 --> 05:30.079
If my powers are my justification,

05:31.789 --> 05:34.709
would you dare to even pick it apart?

05:36.169 --> 05:37.003
[sighs]

05:38.171 --> 05:39.672
- [Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon clears throat]
- [male mage sighs]

05:39.756 --> 05:41.215
[snickers]

05:43.634 --> 05:45.219
It seems that you have no proof.

05:48.473 --> 05:49.557
We can prove it to you now.

06:08.367 --> 06:09.202
We even…

06:10.745 --> 06:11.662
brought our witness here.

06:12.330 --> 06:14.082
[mages murmuring]

06:22.924 --> 06:23.758
They're right here.

06:33.392 --> 06:34.644
[male mage] She's pregnant?

06:35.394 --> 06:37.271
[quirky music playing]

06:37.355 --> 06:38.606
[soft gasp]

06:42.110 --> 06:43.945
So Bu-yeon's with child?

06:44.695 --> 06:45.696
Will this do

06:46.280 --> 06:47.949
as a witness you cannot deny…

06:49.784 --> 06:50.618
for our marriage?

06:50.701 --> 06:52.745
How can we believe you, huh?

06:53.788 --> 06:55.164
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon]
There's a physician here.

06:55.248 --> 06:57.542
Master Heo, please examine her.

06:57.625 --> 07:01.671
Well, I, uh… I can only tell
if it's been 21 days.

07:01.754 --> 07:06.092
Uk, when, uh…
uh, when were you two last together?

07:07.593 --> 07:10.263
[male mage]
How could you even ask such a thing?

07:10.346 --> 07:11.931
Oh, this old man has no shame!

07:12.014 --> 07:13.558
[Buddhist Monk Ho-yeon]
We have to be sure.

07:15.184 --> 07:16.519
Uh, Lady Jin.

07:17.145 --> 07:20.106
Hmm, uh, since it has come to this,

07:20.189 --> 07:22.316
can't we all agree to let her go with him?

07:23.025 --> 07:25.820
Marriage is meant to be
an affair kept in the family.

07:25.903 --> 07:29.073
The Unanimous Assembly
have no reason to discuss this further.

07:29.157 --> 07:31.909
Let's conclude this, yeah? Good! Go, go!

07:50.303 --> 07:51.220
[sighs]

07:58.144 --> 08:01.105
[splutters]
Hey, Uk, were you at the meeting too?

08:04.442 --> 08:06.903
Bu-yeon, where are you going?

08:07.487 --> 08:08.821
I have gotten married to that man.

08:10.198 --> 08:12.492
So from now on,
I'll be living with my husband.

08:12.575 --> 08:13.493
Husband?

08:14.076 --> 08:17.413
You remember? I told you
I was waiting for my groom to come.

08:18.873 --> 08:21.751
He came for me so I'm going with him.

08:30.343 --> 08:31.928
[Cho-yeon] So Jang Uk was the one…

08:33.262 --> 08:35.223
who got her out of that room then.

08:36.140 --> 08:39.352
Did your… uh, your sister just say

08:40.269 --> 08:42.230
that she and Jang Uk got married now?

08:45.191 --> 08:46.192
Oh.

08:52.990 --> 08:56.410
If Jang Uk is now
the Jin family's son-in-law,

08:56.494 --> 08:59.830
I see no reason
that Jinyowon would go to another family.

08:59.914 --> 09:02.708
I agree. With Jang Uk as their son-in-law,

09:02.792 --> 09:04.877
who would dare attack Jinyowon now?

09:04.961 --> 09:05.962
Ho-gyeong.

09:07.505 --> 09:10.550
You put on quite the show to introduce
Jin Bu-yeon to the rest of the world.

09:11.217 --> 09:13.678
In any case,
thanks to your incredible son-in-law,

09:14.303 --> 09:17.974
Jinyowon will remain protected for now.

09:20.393 --> 09:21.227
[sighs]

09:21.978 --> 09:23.229
[snickers]

09:29.777 --> 09:31.904
- [Mr. Lee] Welcome, Young Master Jang.
- [Jang Uk] Mm-hm.

09:33.197 --> 09:35.324
Young Lady Jin, you returned?

09:36.200 --> 09:37.702
- Yes, I did.
- [chuckles]

09:40.079 --> 09:41.289
Young Master.

09:41.372 --> 09:43.374
Where did you go without saying a word?

09:44.417 --> 09:47.253
- Oh, why's the Young Lady back--
- Maid Kim.

09:47.920 --> 09:49.547
[Jang Uk]
She must be exhausted after tonight,

09:49.630 --> 09:51.757
so please, go prepare
a room for her to rest.

09:55.761 --> 09:59.640
I see that you're now dressed
as a proper lady of the Jin family today.

09:59.724 --> 10:01.100
[Bu-yeon chuckles softly]
That's because I was

10:01.183 --> 10:02.268
at the Unanimous Assembly.

10:02.351 --> 10:03.394
You said where?

10:04.645 --> 10:06.606
[gasps]
Wait! Hold on! Did he…

10:06.689 --> 10:08.983
Did the Young Master bring you
straight here from there?

10:10.443 --> 10:14.155
Yes. This time, I truly have come
to live in his house with him.

10:15.406 --> 10:17.325
I hope we can get along well,
Maidservant Kim.

10:17.950 --> 10:18.993
Of course.

10:21.370 --> 10:24.665
So it was Uk that Bu-yeon said
she'd given her heart to.

10:24.749 --> 10:25.583
Then…

10:26.626 --> 10:28.544
does this mean they're together now?

10:28.628 --> 10:30.713
[Dang-gu] When would they have even met?
[exhales sharply]

10:30.796 --> 10:32.006
Oh, wait, hold on!

10:32.089 --> 10:34.342
It must have been
when Uk went into Jinyowon.

10:35.343 --> 10:38.763
Although, has it been 21 days since then?

10:39.889 --> 10:41.932
- 21?
- Never mind, Yul.

10:42.892 --> 10:44.477
[Dang-gu] Wow, can that be true?

10:47.146 --> 10:50.149
[somber music playing]

10:52.568 --> 10:54.487
- But hey, Dang-gu.
- Huh?

10:55.071 --> 10:56.197
Do you really believe it?

10:57.490 --> 10:59.241
That Uk has truly forgotten her…

11:01.577 --> 11:03.245
and has actually given
his heart to this woman?

11:07.291 --> 11:08.626
Of course I don't.

11:10.503 --> 11:11.337
He couldn't have.

11:12.797 --> 11:14.965
I'm sure he has
a different reason for this.

11:16.425 --> 11:18.344
[breathes deeply]

11:19.637 --> 11:20.596
So why?

11:40.324 --> 11:41.951
A Jinyowon relic.

11:42.743 --> 11:46.163
Thanks to you, I was able
to finally get married to him.

11:49.333 --> 11:50.376
Wait a second…

11:55.214 --> 11:57.425
So did I really turn it off? Or did…

11:59.051 --> 12:00.428
Jang Uk turned it off for me

12:01.345 --> 12:02.513
so he could take me with?

12:05.641 --> 12:07.226
There's no way he would.

12:10.563 --> 12:12.940
If I did it, I should be able
to turn it back on.

12:31.667 --> 12:32.626
[exhales sharply]

12:40.134 --> 12:42.303
This is the sword that Uk carries.

12:44.513 --> 12:45.514
So beautiful!

12:48.058 --> 12:49.602
[eerie music playing]

12:51.937 --> 12:53.063
[gasps]

12:55.608 --> 12:57.735
[breathes heavily]

13:01.530 --> 13:02.531
What happened?

13:05.743 --> 13:06.785
Did…

13:08.162 --> 13:09.205
you turn that on?

13:11.749 --> 13:13.042
Did you really do this?

13:14.710 --> 13:16.128
I mean, there's no one here but me,

13:17.713 --> 13:18.964
so then I must have…

13:19.048 --> 13:21.425
What does "I must have" mean?
Why not "I did it"?

13:22.468 --> 13:24.386
I keep seeing these images
flashing in my head,

13:24.470 --> 13:26.889
I think they must be memories
that I had forgotten.

13:27.890 --> 13:30.976
They told me that I would regain
my memories as my powers return.

13:33.354 --> 13:34.230
Do it again.

13:40.152 --> 13:42.154
[suspenseful music playing]

13:48.327 --> 13:50.496
Look! Right there! Look, I did it again!

13:50.579 --> 13:51.872
[chuckles softly]
Well done!

13:51.956 --> 13:54.833
I couldn't recover any memories
while I was in prison.

13:54.917 --> 13:56.669
See! But now that I'm free

13:56.752 --> 13:59.505
and I'm in a new environment,
it's coming back to me.

14:00.089 --> 14:03.092
If you regain your memories like this,
your divine powers will return.

14:03.884 --> 14:04.927
I'm glad I brought you with me.

14:07.137 --> 14:08.222
Thank goodness.

14:09.098 --> 14:12.309
I was a little worried
because it seemed like you were angry.

14:12.393 --> 14:14.144
That was because you went up
and made up a witness

14:14.228 --> 14:15.229
who doesn't even exist.

14:17.439 --> 14:19.441
Oh, so you're not upset
because of my mother then?

14:21.277 --> 14:22.236
It's because of our child?

14:23.070 --> 14:25.781
We got out of that situation
because this baby was our witness.

14:26.365 --> 14:29.201
I was already expecting your mother
to react exactly the way she did.

14:29.285 --> 14:30.202
And for that baby…

14:35.916 --> 14:37.376
The way we keep talking about it
makes me think

14:37.459 --> 14:38.836
there's really something in there, ugh.

14:39.628 --> 14:40.629
So what do we do?

14:41.881 --> 14:42.923
That physician, Heo Yeom,

14:43.007 --> 14:45.593
wants to examine me
after 21 days have passed.

14:46.176 --> 14:47.469
I can't say there's no baby.

14:47.553 --> 14:50.180
Okay, then what?
We should make a baby before then?

14:51.932 --> 14:53.934
[soft music playing]

15:03.277 --> 15:05.321
[splutters]
What? No!

15:12.536 --> 15:13.704
To tell you the truth,

15:14.663 --> 15:15.497
I was hoping that…

15:16.290 --> 15:18.918
you were the one who put out the light
at the Unanimous Assembly,

15:19.001 --> 15:20.794
and even though you didn't need me…

15:23.756 --> 15:25.257
you still chose to take me with.

15:28.218 --> 15:29.929
Even if it was me who did that,

15:30.763 --> 15:32.848
you really should know
it wasn't for the reason you were…

15:34.308 --> 15:35.142
hoping for.

15:41.106 --> 15:42.733
So what do you wanna do about this?

15:42.816 --> 15:46.862
Well, if you want, I can help you create
a witness to bring forth to Sejukwon

15:46.946 --> 15:47.947
within 21 days.

15:49.073 --> 15:51.784
Just as long as you don't continue
to hope like that.

15:59.833 --> 16:02.544
[soft music playing]

16:21.730 --> 16:25.109
Let's say that our witness
was created together

16:26.026 --> 16:27.236
since we're married, after all.

16:28.404 --> 16:29.947
I can't say I made it all on my own.

16:31.949 --> 16:32.866
[Bu-yeon] You said you would help.

16:34.535 --> 16:35.536
Don't resent me.

16:37.371 --> 16:39.081
Are you gonna keep lying
that this witness exists?

16:39.164 --> 16:41.166
- [chimes]
- [Bu-yeon groans]

16:41.250 --> 16:42.292
[sighs]

16:42.376 --> 16:43.836
- [Bu-yeon breathes heavily]
- [Jang Uk] What's wrong now?

16:44.461 --> 16:45.838
Stop acting so erratically.

16:45.921 --> 16:48.549
[breathing heavily]

16:52.720 --> 16:54.555
- What is it?
- Don't mind me.

17:02.521 --> 17:05.399
- What is this?
- She sewed the tracking thread into me.

17:06.567 --> 17:07.526
The one you broke, remember?

17:08.986 --> 17:10.738
[Bu-yeon] And it hurts
because the thread's getting tighter.

17:11.655 --> 17:12.614
It seems that…

17:14.867 --> 17:16.493
mother is calling for me to return.

17:27.963 --> 17:30.382
[tense music playing]

17:34.887 --> 17:37.181
I cannot allow you to stay with that man.

17:38.891 --> 17:39.808
You'll be back,

17:40.934 --> 17:42.019
my sweet Bu-yeon.

17:52.905 --> 17:54.364
[sucks teeth, groans]

17:56.492 --> 17:57.367
[exclaims]

17:58.619 --> 18:00.287
Regardless of what's going on,

18:01.080 --> 18:03.290
how could a mother do something like this?

18:06.502 --> 18:09.421
Oh, dear, you must be
in excruciating pain.

18:10.506 --> 18:12.174
I think you should return back home.

18:12.257 --> 18:14.551
I'll tell the young master
to escort you there.

18:15.177 --> 18:16.261
[gasps]

18:16.345 --> 18:17.471
Please don't do that!

18:18.388 --> 18:19.932
I told him that I would deal with it.

18:21.266 --> 18:22.559
Please do not ask him to send me back.

18:22.643 --> 18:25.145
But you're in
so much pain now, Young Lady.

18:27.231 --> 18:29.108
If I'm unable to endure this pain,

18:30.192 --> 18:32.027
then I do not deserve to take…

18:33.987 --> 18:35.030
what I truly desire.

18:38.367 --> 18:40.119
The pain that does not kill me now…

18:41.703 --> 18:42.538
eventually…

18:45.833 --> 18:47.167
I know will set me free.

18:59.263 --> 19:02.224
Young Master.
Young Lady Bu-yeon is in great pain.

19:02.307 --> 19:03.142
And so what?

19:03.892 --> 19:04.726
She wants to go back?

19:04.810 --> 19:06.270
No, she refused that.

19:06.353 --> 19:08.939
I applied some ointment for her,
but she's still in agony.

19:12.860 --> 19:14.278
She said that she could bear it.

19:15.195 --> 19:16.196
Just apply more ointment.

19:20.534 --> 19:22.494
He's the one who brought the girl here.

19:23.036 --> 19:24.454
How could he be so cold?

19:25.622 --> 19:26.456
[sighs]

19:27.249 --> 19:29.251
[somber music playing]

19:32.588 --> 19:35.340
Mother, stop! Please make it stop!

19:39.761 --> 19:41.471
[grunts in pain]
Make it stop!

19:42.764 --> 19:44.308
[groans, breathes heavily]

20:14.671 --> 20:17.299
[Jin Mu]
Her face was identical to Naksu's,

20:17.382 --> 20:19.843
except her build and aura
were quite different.

20:21.261 --> 20:23.138
Naksu was never that small and slender.

20:25.265 --> 20:27.809
I need to find out
whatever I can about Jin Bu-yeon.

20:29.686 --> 20:30.729
So-i comes for her medicine

20:30.812 --> 20:32.689
- around now, right?
- Yeah.

20:36.318 --> 20:37.861
I need that girl.

20:40.113 --> 20:43.200
[indistinct chatter]

20:55.587 --> 20:56.964
- [So-i] 93.
- [man groans]

20:57.464 --> 20:58.674
94.

20:59.675 --> 21:01.009
95.

21:02.094 --> 21:03.136
96.

21:04.763 --> 21:06.556
- 97.
- [water splashing]

21:07.182 --> 21:08.600
98.

21:09.518 --> 21:10.477
99.

21:11.144 --> 21:12.813
Now.

21:12.896 --> 21:14.815
- [Sang-gu groans]
- Sang-gu, are you okay?

21:15.482 --> 21:16.316
Oh, my goodness.

21:16.942 --> 21:19.111
Do you want your little brother
to stay safe and sound?

21:20.904 --> 21:22.239
Then pay me what you owe.

21:22.322 --> 21:23.365
[sobs]

21:24.408 --> 21:26.994
You said you sold your land.
Where's the money from that?

21:27.077 --> 21:29.204
I don't have any left. I've used it all.

21:30.038 --> 21:30.956
Is that so?

21:32.124 --> 21:33.333
Think carefully about that.

21:33.417 --> 21:35.085
[So-i] Otherwise,
I'll count to 200 this time.

21:36.628 --> 21:37.713
Dunk him.

21:37.796 --> 21:39.881
[Byeong-gu cries]
No! Sang-gu! Sang-gu! Please!

21:39.965 --> 21:41.258
- [sobs]
- Two.

21:41.883 --> 21:42.718
- Three.
- [Byeong-gu] Oh! Sang-gu! Please!

21:42.801 --> 21:44.094
- Madam.
- [So-i] Four.

21:45.887 --> 21:46.805
And five.

21:48.598 --> 21:49.558
And six.

21:51.435 --> 21:52.311
Seven.

21:54.730 --> 21:55.772
And eight.

21:55.856 --> 21:57.983
[suspenseful music playing]

21:58.066 --> 21:58.900
Nine.

22:00.610 --> 22:01.445
Ten.

22:02.612 --> 22:03.572
[Bu-yeon grunts in pain]

22:07.868 --> 22:09.578
[groaning softly]

22:19.338 --> 22:20.213
Bu-yeon, please.

22:21.673 --> 22:23.425
Why are you making me hurt you?

22:24.301 --> 22:25.135
Come back to me.

22:30.724 --> 22:32.726
[suspenseful music playing]

22:33.435 --> 22:34.478
[door opens]

22:41.651 --> 22:42.694
What did you just do?

22:45.238 --> 22:47.115
It's impossible for my wife to sleep.

22:48.366 --> 22:50.327
Please show some courtesy
and refrain from calling your daughter

22:50.410 --> 22:51.578
in the middle of the night.

22:51.661 --> 22:52.704
As you may know,

22:54.122 --> 22:55.957
the two of us haven't been married
for very long.

22:56.041 --> 22:59.044
[tense music playing]

23:30.242 --> 23:32.244
[soft music playing]

23:35.080 --> 23:36.123
[exhales deeply]

24:11.908 --> 24:13.326
It doesn't hurt.

24:16.746 --> 24:18.748
Mother must have given up calling for now.

24:23.587 --> 24:24.421
[sighs]

24:26.256 --> 24:27.507
In return for the medicine…

24:30.385 --> 24:31.595
he wants you to bring her to him.

24:33.180 --> 24:34.181
Jin Bu-yeon?

24:34.890 --> 24:36.433
Jinyowon's next heir?

24:39.811 --> 24:40.979
But is this girl really her?

24:41.062 --> 24:42.105
Don't be clever!

24:42.189 --> 24:44.816
All you need is to do exactly
what the Gwanju ordered you to.

24:46.109 --> 24:48.737
The only reason that you're still alive
despite that blood parasite

24:48.820 --> 24:51.072
is because of the medicine
the Gwanju bestows upon you.

24:54.159 --> 24:57.204
Have I ever done anything
other than what's been asked of me?

24:58.371 --> 25:00.207
I'll bring her
to that chamber in Cheonbugwan.

25:12.427 --> 25:14.763
[Seo Yul] Have you told the person
who has been giving me this medicine

25:14.846 --> 25:16.264
that I wish to meet them?

25:17.307 --> 25:20.018
They refused,
said there is no need to meet you.

25:21.561 --> 25:24.689
But I have discovered more
about who this person really is.

25:25.815 --> 25:27.984
- Is this someone named So-i?
- [sighs]

25:28.902 --> 25:30.237
I knew it. You know each other then.

25:31.488 --> 25:34.908
That woman is the actual owner
of a notorious gambling den.

25:34.991 --> 25:36.701
Cheonbugwan is
behind her illegal business,

25:36.785 --> 25:38.203
according to the rumors.

25:39.412 --> 25:41.957
I don't really feel comfortable
giving you this medicine

25:42.457 --> 25:44.501
knowing that it came from such a woman.

25:45.627 --> 25:47.087
Where can I find this gambling den?

25:47.170 --> 25:48.505
It's in Gaema Village, Young Master.

25:49.339 --> 25:50.298
[Ju-wol] But that medicine,

25:50.382 --> 25:52.926
are you forced to take it
because of some illness?

25:53.009 --> 25:56.137
Is that why you're staying here
instead of Songrim, so you can hide it?

25:56.721 --> 25:57.555
That's not why.

25:58.431 --> 26:01.685
I'm simply more comfortable here.
You have nothing to worry about.

26:02.769 --> 26:03.603
[sighs]

26:09.943 --> 26:10.819
[Maid Kim] Young Master.

26:12.404 --> 26:13.488
Did you just go somewhere?

26:13.571 --> 26:15.865
What is wrong?
Why are you still up at this hour?

26:15.949 --> 26:17.409
How could I rest now?

26:18.994 --> 26:21.871
You want me to stay up and just worry?

26:22.622 --> 26:23.540
Oh…

26:26.001 --> 26:26.835
Maidservant Kim.

26:28.128 --> 26:29.629
I'm sorry for getting married
without a word.

26:29.713 --> 26:31.298
I should have asked
for your permission first.

26:31.381 --> 26:34.134
If you were truly sorry,
you would be having a nice wedding.

26:34.217 --> 26:37.220
Until then, I won't consider her
the lady of this house.

26:37.304 --> 26:39.848
And I won't be calling you
"my lord" either, okay?

26:40.515 --> 26:43.226
[scoffs]
Fine. Then prepare for a wedding.

26:48.023 --> 26:48.898
Do you mean it?

26:49.899 --> 26:52.360
But not my wedding though.
Prepare your wedding.

26:52.944 --> 26:55.280
- What do--
- I told you I already got married.

26:56.114 --> 26:58.658
So you can move out now and be with him.

27:00.368 --> 27:01.244
Now you can do that.

27:01.328 --> 27:02.871
What will you do if I go

27:03.913 --> 27:05.081
and get married to Lord Park?

27:05.165 --> 27:07.250
Bu-yeon and I are both gonna get
what we want.

27:07.334 --> 27:09.919
She says that they hid her
so no one knew she existed.

27:11.212 --> 27:12.672
This way, Bu-yeon can be free now.

27:14.299 --> 27:15.258
And I know I will be too.

27:15.342 --> 27:17.802
Should I understand
you're doing this to let go of…

27:19.095 --> 27:20.513
what happened to you back then?

27:24.684 --> 27:25.560
[sighs]

27:27.228 --> 27:30.440
I'm going to say what I…
I've meant to say.

27:35.028 --> 27:37.697
That red egg-shaped stone
where you keep your heart,

27:39.616 --> 27:41.159
you must get rid of it.

27:42.786 --> 27:44.871
Why are you still holding on
to the yin-yang jade,

27:44.954 --> 27:46.414
when you shared it with that dead woman?

27:46.498 --> 27:47.707
You know it's known…

27:48.541 --> 27:50.126
for calling the one you shared it with.

27:52.462 --> 27:53.296
I am…

27:54.255 --> 27:56.800
so afraid that one day,
that dead woman will call for you…

27:58.259 --> 27:59.552
and take you with her.

28:00.887 --> 28:03.765
- [somber music playing]
- [Maid Kim breathes shakily]

28:15.610 --> 28:16.444
Don't worry.

28:17.028 --> 28:17.946
She's never once…

28:19.406 --> 28:20.990
called me using this jade.

28:23.284 --> 28:24.577
[Maid Kim] That girl is dead.

28:25.203 --> 28:28.373
That thing that hatched out
of that egg you nurtured…

28:28.957 --> 28:31.000
was nothing more
than a vicious bird of prey.

28:32.168 --> 28:34.921
And they dealt the horrific wound
to the person who nurtured it

28:35.004 --> 28:36.131
before they died.

28:36.214 --> 28:37.132
So, please…

28:38.258 --> 28:39.634
just destroy the stone.

28:41.094 --> 28:42.720
The reason I'm still holding this…

28:44.514 --> 28:46.474
is that I have to be certain
she's still dead.

28:48.685 --> 28:50.895
The only way I'll believe
she really is dead…

28:52.647 --> 28:54.357
is if I'm able to see it with my own eyes.

28:56.985 --> 28:57.819
Because…

28:59.320 --> 29:01.322
I never really witnessed her death myself.

29:12.792 --> 29:14.586
Who are they saying is dead?

29:15.628 --> 29:16.546
A bird?

29:25.972 --> 29:28.308
Now that it doesn't hurt,
I can sleep in peace.

29:34.522 --> 29:36.733
Should I tell him it doesn't hurt anymore?

29:37.317 --> 29:38.943
I hope that he isn't really worried.

29:50.288 --> 29:51.164
[exhales sharply]

30:05.720 --> 30:07.305
[Bu-yeon] He'd never be worried about me.

30:08.932 --> 30:10.934
[somber music playing]

30:24.447 --> 30:25.365
[Maid Kim] Young Lady.

30:26.115 --> 30:28.868
These people here are like family
to the Young Master.

30:30.161 --> 30:32.705
I'm the Jin family's eldest daughter,
Jin Bu-yeon.

30:33.706 --> 30:34.541
Nice to meet you.

30:36.751 --> 30:40.171
Is it really true
that you and Uk are married?

30:40.255 --> 30:42.048
This is why she came here to meet us.

30:43.091 --> 30:46.135
In any case, now that you two are married,
I congratulate you both.

30:46.219 --> 30:48.930
Not yet! Well, of course,
they'll have a wedding

30:49.013 --> 30:50.014
to make it official.

30:50.098 --> 30:55.478
Until that day, she's the heir to Jinyowon
and remains betrothed to the Young Master.

30:55.562 --> 30:58.648
Since she's adamant
on only calling you his betrothed,

30:58.731 --> 31:00.692
you must have lied about the baby too.

31:01.693 --> 31:02.861
My apologies.

31:02.944 --> 31:05.029
I thought a fight would break out
so I had to lie.

31:05.113 --> 31:06.906
Goodness. You're bold, aren't you?

31:09.993 --> 31:13.663
Have I… Have I ever seen you
for treatment before, Young Lady?

31:13.746 --> 31:14.914
I feel like I've seen you.

31:14.998 --> 31:16.249
I don't believe so.

31:16.791 --> 31:18.877
They told me I was treated
by the best physician

31:18.960 --> 31:20.461
that Daeho Fortress has to offer.

31:20.545 --> 31:22.422
I'm the best physician in Daeho Fortress.

31:22.505 --> 31:24.507
Who else is there? Give me their name.

31:24.591 --> 31:27.051
[Dang-gu] Uh, come on,
Master Heo, that's enough.

31:27.135 --> 31:29.012
She was never allowed to leave Jinyowon.

31:29.762 --> 31:32.223
What I heard,
she also suffers from memory loss.

31:33.558 --> 31:34.976
You've lost some of your memories?

31:36.436 --> 31:39.314
After I woke from an illness,
I had no memories at all.

31:39.397 --> 31:40.440
With that said,

31:40.523 --> 31:42.734
I'm still able to see energy,
the same way I could,

31:42.817 --> 31:43.943
like when I was a child.

31:46.362 --> 31:49.032
I can see that there's
a great energy within you two.

31:50.325 --> 31:54.203
You are one of the few mages I've met
with exceptionally strong powers.

31:54.287 --> 31:57.040
You can tell that
just by taking a look at us?

31:57.874 --> 32:01.502
As for you though,
your energy may not be as strong,

32:02.128 --> 32:04.213
but it shines so bright with purity.

32:04.297 --> 32:06.758
Everyone knows
Dang-gu has a great personality.

32:06.841 --> 32:09.302
That's what you call an ability?
Whatever. Come on!

32:09.385 --> 32:13.598
Your energy reminds me of my little sister
since it's so very clear and light.

32:14.474 --> 32:17.018
You must have heard then,
all about me from my sister.

32:17.101 --> 32:18.478
Uh…

32:18.561 --> 32:21.022
Are you and Jin Cho-yeon together again?

32:21.105 --> 32:23.399
- Well… no, no, we're not.
- He's not.

32:24.400 --> 32:26.736
- We only met to talk about Bu-yeon--
- [Jin] Dang-gu.

32:26.819 --> 32:28.154
- You met her?
- What?

32:29.030 --> 32:29.906
Uh, I-I did.

32:29.989 --> 32:34.410
And I've also been sensing the energy
of two other people from over there.

32:34.494 --> 32:36.329
Whose energy
are you talking about right now?

32:36.412 --> 32:38.957
Come on! If anyone's there, come out.

32:48.132 --> 32:49.550
Ugh, why is she…

32:49.634 --> 32:50.969
What are you two doing over there?

32:51.052 --> 32:52.220
[chuckles awkwardly]

33:01.479 --> 33:05.483
So what did you see in Jang Uk then?

33:06.192 --> 33:07.944
He had the energy of the sky within him.

33:08.695 --> 33:09.529
That's right.

33:10.363 --> 33:13.282
Uk had died once but then was revived

33:13.992 --> 33:15.159
because of that energy.

33:18.121 --> 33:19.288
So I was told.

33:20.331 --> 33:22.250
Since I have the power to see his energy,

33:22.875 --> 33:25.128
I'll make sure
I stay by his side and protect him.

33:29.507 --> 33:31.968
What do you think about Bu-yeon, my lord?

33:32.051 --> 33:35.346
She does appear to be
a great priestess with a unique power.

33:35.430 --> 33:37.890
But it seems like
she married our young master

33:38.391 --> 33:39.892
because she wants to leave Jinyowon.

33:41.394 --> 33:43.479
Even Young Master Jang…

33:44.814 --> 33:46.774
said he was only getting married
for my sake.

33:48.067 --> 33:49.777
He's getting married for your sake?

33:49.861 --> 33:52.947
He's trying to use it
as a way to let me know that I can stop…

33:53.031 --> 33:54.824
[chuckles]
…worrying about him now.

33:58.953 --> 34:00.371
You do know what this means, right?

34:05.293 --> 34:07.420
I'll always be ready with open arms

34:07.962 --> 34:10.506
for the moment you know
you can come to me, Maid Kim.

34:14.260 --> 34:16.679
[soft music playing]

34:20.183 --> 34:24.020
But it seems that there's something
still troubling your heart right now.

34:25.480 --> 34:26.898
There's no need to rush.

34:26.981 --> 34:29.817
I won't force you to come to me
if you aren't ready.

34:31.110 --> 34:34.489
And yet, my heart is beating so fast now.

34:34.572 --> 34:35.823
And mine as well.

34:37.033 --> 34:41.370
I may tell you it's okay but I can't hide
how much I wish to hold you.

34:51.172 --> 34:52.006
I…

34:52.507 --> 34:54.342
have my own desires like you.

34:56.719 --> 34:58.262
[both laugh]

35:03.351 --> 35:07.021
[Maid Kim] Master Heo doesn't seem
very fond of the Young Lady yet.

35:07.980 --> 35:09.982
Saying she looked familiar
just to pick a fight.

35:10.566 --> 35:14.028
Actually, I thought the same.
Something about her seemed familiar.

35:14.112 --> 35:15.780
I feel like I've seen her somewhere else.

35:16.572 --> 35:17.698
Is that so?

35:18.366 --> 35:20.368
You knew that dress from a single glance.

35:20.451 --> 35:23.329
Yeah, right! I know
I've seen her somewhere before.

35:23.412 --> 35:24.288
Of course you have.

35:25.373 --> 35:26.707
That dress that she had on

35:27.291 --> 35:30.419
was the one that Madam Do-hwa
used to wear often before she was married.

35:30.503 --> 35:32.505
Ah! That's right.
[chuckles]

35:32.588 --> 35:34.048
That's why she looked so familiar to me.

35:34.882 --> 35:37.677
Back then, I'd written Do-hwa
a beautiful poem

35:37.760 --> 35:39.512
just after I saw her in that same dress.

35:39.595 --> 35:41.264
[chuckles]

35:41.347 --> 35:44.809
[soft dramatic music playing]

35:47.645 --> 35:49.438
So this is the power of your first love.

35:49.522 --> 35:53.067
A man who can't take a hint
but knows his first love right away.

35:54.152 --> 35:56.112
- You must have been happy.
- Maid Kim, look at me.

35:57.363 --> 36:00.867
This heart is racing only because of you.

36:00.950 --> 36:01.909
Too late now.

36:03.286 --> 36:05.413
[soft music playing]

36:08.791 --> 36:09.876
Listen carefully.

36:11.043 --> 36:13.171
Can you hear my heart?

36:14.338 --> 36:15.173
[chuckles]

36:16.716 --> 36:17.717
I can hear well.

36:18.968 --> 36:20.303
I was only teasing you.

36:20.887 --> 36:21.929
[Maid Kim] You can let go now.

36:22.013 --> 36:22.972
[Maid Kim gasps]

36:26.350 --> 36:27.894
You're finally in my arms.

36:28.728 --> 36:30.646
I can't let you go now.

36:47.038 --> 36:48.623
[Bu-yeon]
I really don't need you to walk me home.

36:48.706 --> 36:51.000
I may have lost my memory,
but I am not helpless.

36:51.667 --> 36:53.669
Uh, please don't misunderstand.

36:53.753 --> 36:56.047
[Dang-gu] She only told us
because she was concerned for you.

36:56.130 --> 36:58.591
She's having a hard time
coming to terms with you marrying Uk.

36:58.674 --> 37:00.968
To be honest, it's hard for me too.

37:02.053 --> 37:04.513
She asked me
to keep an eye out for you, Bu-yeon.

37:04.597 --> 37:06.390
Cho-yeon couldn't really defend me

37:06.474 --> 37:08.434
because she was too afraid
of my mother but…

37:09.602 --> 37:11.812
- I know she is pure and kind-hearted.
- Mm.

37:13.564 --> 37:15.191
Um, is your wound

37:15.274 --> 37:16.651
from the tracking thread
healing all right?

37:17.652 --> 37:20.112
She said she was relieved
that it won't be hurting you anymore.

37:20.196 --> 37:24.200
Do you think Cho-yeon secretly hid
the spool of tracking thread somewhere

37:24.909 --> 37:26.202
so Mother cannot use it anymore?

37:28.955 --> 37:30.623
Is that why the pain suddenly stopped?

37:30.706 --> 37:31.540
What?

37:33.084 --> 37:36.629
Then you don't know? No one told you
anything about what happened last night?

37:37.880 --> 37:38.839
What happened last night?

37:38.923 --> 37:40.258
The spool was destroyed.

37:41.008 --> 37:43.469
Uk stormed into Jinyowon
in the middle of the night

37:43.552 --> 37:44.512
and shattered it.

37:49.433 --> 37:51.227
Hmm, I heard because of him,

37:52.228 --> 37:54.480
Jinyowon was in utter chaos last night.

37:54.563 --> 37:56.899
Did you really not know any of this?

37:57.858 --> 37:58.859
I really didn't know.

37:59.986 --> 38:00.820
He…

38:03.406 --> 38:04.490
told me to just bear it.

38:05.074 --> 38:05.992
[Dang-gu] Hmm.

38:06.075 --> 38:08.202
["Blue Flower" by LIA playing]

38:22.883 --> 38:25.052
[Dang-gu] During the day,
Uk often goes to the Dark Forest,

38:25.136 --> 38:28.848
which gets its name from how dense
the cypress trees grow in there.

38:33.394 --> 38:36.564
Deep within the forest,
you can find some stone towers.

38:36.647 --> 38:38.733
Every single one of those towers
was stacked by Uk,

38:39.275 --> 38:40.943
one for every soul shifter he's killed.

38:41.027 --> 38:43.112
He's turned it
into some kind of graveyard.

38:44.488 --> 38:47.241
Everyone in Daeho was too scared
to get anywhere close.

38:47.908 --> 38:50.661
But Uk seems to prefer it

38:51.245 --> 38:52.830
as he goes there quite often.

38:53.831 --> 38:56.876
["Blue Flower" by Lia continues playing]

39:18.272 --> 39:19.315
[sighs]

39:20.733 --> 39:23.277
He said that he'd be here but he's not.

39:24.612 --> 39:26.906
Do all of these graves
belong to soul shifters?

39:38.125 --> 39:39.001
Oh…

39:40.252 --> 39:41.212
Right…

39:42.671 --> 39:43.881
one of those is hers.

39:46.550 --> 39:47.802
I guess she'll see it.

39:55.309 --> 39:57.019
Then you found and killed
that soul shifter, right?

39:58.562 --> 39:59.397
She died.

40:00.272 --> 40:02.608
The grave of the soul shifter
he mentioned before…

40:04.568 --> 40:05.945
must be here then.

40:09.782 --> 40:10.616
[sighs]

40:10.699 --> 40:13.244
- [Mu-deok] Bird's eggs.
- [Jang Uk] We'll each keep one, okay?

40:13.327 --> 40:14.829
[eerie music playing]

40:14.912 --> 40:16.789
[Jang Uk] I pick red. You can have blue.

40:17.957 --> 40:19.250
[loud rumbling]

40:27.133 --> 40:28.968
I didn't even touch it.

40:30.386 --> 40:31.720
So why did this collapse?

40:34.306 --> 40:36.267
[somber music playing]

40:59.957 --> 41:02.835
This is not an ordinary stone.

41:09.175 --> 41:11.135
[Bu-yeon]
In that memory, I saw this exact stone.

41:12.011 --> 41:13.512
Did this come from Jinyowon?

41:14.221 --> 41:15.848
Did I see this as a child?

41:23.689 --> 41:24.982
[So-i] Who is this woman?

41:25.065 --> 41:28.235
Jin Bu-yeon was really Mu-deok,
and Mu-deok is already dead.

41:35.618 --> 41:37.244
If this is from Jinyowon,

41:38.204 --> 41:39.788
would Cho-yeon know about this?

41:42.958 --> 41:44.543
[ominous music playing]

41:47.546 --> 41:48.547
[gasps]

41:49.757 --> 41:51.467
[Bu-yeon] Hey! Stop right there!

41:54.386 --> 41:55.429
I said stop!

41:55.513 --> 41:57.264
[man 1] Hey, watch out!

41:58.140 --> 41:59.308
- [man 2] Oh!
- [Bu-yeon] Oh, my…

41:59.391 --> 42:01.268
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

42:02.853 --> 42:03.896
I am sorry.

42:03.979 --> 42:05.814
[suspenseful music playing]

42:12.404 --> 42:14.698
Lure her toward Cheonbugwan's back door.

42:14.782 --> 42:16.617
Yeom-su will be waiting there.

42:16.700 --> 42:17.701
[errand boy] Yes, Madam.

42:17.785 --> 42:19.078
Once she lures her,

42:19.161 --> 42:21.497
Jin Bu-yeon will be brought
straight over here.

42:28.921 --> 42:31.882
After I read her mind
using this precious incense,

42:32.883 --> 42:37.096
I will know for certain
whether that girl really is Jin Bu-yeon.

42:43.060 --> 42:45.062
[suspenseful music continues playing]

42:56.198 --> 42:57.157
That's odd.

42:58.075 --> 42:59.952
The stone's energy is over there.

43:06.417 --> 43:08.252
[indistinct chatter]

43:18.012 --> 43:20.389
How did she know to follow me over here?

43:36.739 --> 43:38.741
[ominous music playing]

43:57.551 --> 43:59.136
Seeing that you're hiding,
you must have noticed

43:59.219 --> 44:00.095
I've been following you.

44:12.274 --> 44:14.193
[Bu-yeon]
You must be wondering how I knew.

44:15.110 --> 44:16.779
I have the power to see energy.

44:17.946 --> 44:19.865
That means even if you're hiding,
I can see yours too.

44:20.699 --> 44:22.451
I can even see the stone's energy.

44:26.580 --> 44:28.582
[tense music playing]

44:32.878 --> 44:34.129
[explosion]

44:44.807 --> 44:45.683
[Bu-yeon] I sense bad energy.

44:47.059 --> 44:48.352
I should not inhale any of this.

44:51.647 --> 44:52.856
She can see energy?

44:54.066 --> 44:56.151
Jin Bu-yeon's supposed to have
that kind of power.

44:57.111 --> 44:59.279
I'll wait until the soporific
makes her pass out,

45:00.322 --> 45:01.490
then take her to Cheonbugwan.

45:03.200 --> 45:04.910
- [man 1] Please come again! Bye!
- [man 2] Thank you!

45:08.455 --> 45:09.790
I'm here to see the owner.

45:11.583 --> 45:13.252
Go down there
and she'll be in the last room.

45:26.515 --> 45:28.058
Madam, I've been looking for you.

45:28.142 --> 45:29.435
[man 3] Someone came to see you.

45:38.652 --> 45:40.654
[foreboding music playing]

46:00.174 --> 46:01.216
It smells like soporifics.

46:04.386 --> 46:06.972
[suspenseful music playing]

46:11.602 --> 46:13.312
[gasping]

46:20.319 --> 46:21.570
- Jin Bu-yeon?
- Oh…

46:23.447 --> 46:24.531
[gasps]

46:25.782 --> 46:27.034
So what are you doing in here?

46:27.117 --> 46:30.078
I have been chasing this… this pickpocket.

46:30.162 --> 46:31.538
What are you doing here?

46:32.331 --> 46:33.582
[Seo Yul] I came here to see someone.

46:38.170 --> 46:39.254
Ugh! Gosh.

46:45.344 --> 46:46.220
[grunts]

46:47.054 --> 46:47.888
Oh, gosh.

46:50.849 --> 46:51.808
Grab onto me.

46:53.185 --> 46:55.062
But you'll get as wet as me then.

46:56.230 --> 46:58.482
- That's all right.
- Why, thank you.

47:05.364 --> 47:07.115
[Bu-yeon grunts]

47:09.326 --> 47:11.370
[quirky music playing]

47:13.413 --> 47:14.414
[Bu-yeon] Hang on, just wait!

47:23.882 --> 47:26.301
There was this gas everywhere,
so I jumped into the water.

47:28.720 --> 47:30.347
I thought I would drown in that tub.

47:31.348 --> 47:34.309
[breathing deeply]

47:41.441 --> 47:43.277
Uh, cover up, please.

47:43.860 --> 47:45.571
But I'm not cold.
[sniffles]

47:46.697 --> 47:47.656
[Seo Yul sighs]

47:50.117 --> 47:51.785
I must have looked mortifying, I assume.

47:56.415 --> 47:57.958
Thank you for this too.

48:01.253 --> 48:03.046
So would you like me to help you
catch your pickpocket?

48:03.130 --> 48:04.756
I got back what's mine.

48:04.840 --> 48:07.009
I don't want to cause a scene,
so I'll just go.

48:08.135 --> 48:10.178
Go on. Go meet
with whoever you came to see.

48:11.054 --> 48:13.140
I'm not in a rush,
so please allow me to walk with you.

48:13.849 --> 48:16.602
This neighborhood can be
very dangerous to walk in alone.

48:21.356 --> 48:22.858
[Seo Yul]
This place is called Gaema Village.

48:23.817 --> 48:26.320
You can find many shamans
that practice fortune-telling here.

48:26.403 --> 48:27.404
There're some…

48:27.946 --> 48:29.865
who even practice sorcery in these parts.

48:31.116 --> 48:34.036
[Bu-yeon] That must be why
the roads feel so dark and cold here.

48:34.119 --> 48:37.205
If you must come to a dangerous place
such as this, Uk should come with you.

48:38.540 --> 48:40.083
[Bu-yeon] Do you know Jang Uk?

48:40.167 --> 48:41.668
How do you know each other if I may ask?

48:43.503 --> 48:45.672
Dang-gu, Uk, and I have been friends
since we were children.

48:45.756 --> 48:47.966
- Ah!
- For the past three years,

48:48.050 --> 48:50.510
I had to return to my hometown,
and only just recently came back.

48:50.594 --> 48:52.095
Dang-gu and I already met the other day.

48:52.179 --> 48:54.306
He's someone with very bright energy.

48:56.475 --> 48:57.559
And as for you…

49:01.647 --> 49:04.399
[soft music playing]

49:07.778 --> 49:10.530
I'm a little jealous that you've had
such old friends though.

49:12.783 --> 49:14.034
Oh, and…

49:15.911 --> 49:18.455
I feel like we've been walking in circles
for a while now.

49:22.042 --> 49:24.920
Uh, I lose my sense of direction
when I get distracted.

49:25.003 --> 49:26.046
I'm very sorry.

49:29.007 --> 49:30.384
I think we should go that way.

49:33.595 --> 49:34.763
We already went that way.

49:36.973 --> 49:38.058
Let's go this way.

49:41.144 --> 49:44.564
We've walked here so many times,
I've memorized it. So just follow me.

49:51.697 --> 49:52.864
[Seo Yul] It's my fault for getting lost.

49:53.657 --> 49:54.491
I'm very sorry.

49:54.574 --> 49:55.867
That's all right though.

49:56.702 --> 49:57.828
Who cares if you're a little dumb.

49:59.579 --> 50:01.415
- Not when you're handsome.
- I just got flustered.

50:01.498 --> 50:02.999
No one thinks that I'm dumb!

50:03.834 --> 50:04.668
Yeah, sure.

50:05.669 --> 50:07.045
I don't think you're understanding me.

50:10.173 --> 50:12.926
I was always the top pupil
during my training in Jeongjingak,

50:13.009 --> 50:14.928
and I'd mastered every book.
They would even say

50:15.011 --> 50:16.763
if you don't know something, ask Seo Yul.

50:16.847 --> 50:18.181
I'm that Seo Yul, okay?

50:19.182 --> 50:20.058
[Bu-yeon] Hmm.

50:21.852 --> 50:22.853
So you're actually smart?

50:24.771 --> 50:25.939
How very unfortunate!

50:29.484 --> 50:30.694
As you can see,

50:31.987 --> 50:33.488
my beauty is unmatched.

50:35.198 --> 50:36.450
But I'm not bright.

50:38.869 --> 50:42.247
With how foolish you seemed,
and since you're also handsome,

50:42.330 --> 50:43.665
I felt a sense of kinship.

50:45.292 --> 50:46.793
It's a shame you're smart, you know.

50:48.420 --> 50:49.546
If that's the case then,

50:50.380 --> 50:53.592
I can deem myself a fool too.
We can be two foolish friends.

50:55.719 --> 50:56.595
Well, then, thank you.

50:57.888 --> 50:58.722
[chuckles softly]

51:00.265 --> 51:03.518
Oh, there's something
I've been wondering about for a while.

51:05.020 --> 51:07.606
Was there a soul shifter
who regained their sight?

51:09.107 --> 51:12.819
Uk said he got close enough to be able
to see the blue mark in their eyes so…

51:13.987 --> 51:15.113
do you know who that was, Yul?

51:17.032 --> 51:18.950
That was a soul shifter known as Naksu.

51:19.034 --> 51:20.118
Naksu?

51:21.703 --> 51:22.871
I heard she had died.

51:24.122 --> 51:24.956
Yeah.

51:25.957 --> 51:27.918
Uk had also been murdered
at the hand of her blade.

51:28.710 --> 51:29.544
Ah.

51:32.839 --> 51:34.883
So Naksu was his enemy, I guess.

51:39.137 --> 51:40.847
So you really didn't know
about any of this?

51:42.182 --> 51:43.183
I didn't know.

51:45.519 --> 51:48.939
I guess I should be careful
not to mention her to Jang Uk.

51:53.735 --> 51:55.111
Thank you for letting me know.

52:14.756 --> 52:16.800
That girl has the ability to see energy?

52:18.426 --> 52:20.303
She must be the real Jin Bu-yeon then.

52:21.388 --> 52:22.264
Did you not…

52:22.889 --> 52:25.642
say you were the one who threw her
into the lake when she was a child?

52:25.725 --> 52:27.936
Aren't you worried
that people will find out about that?

52:30.105 --> 52:31.940
Her dead father pushed her.

52:33.608 --> 52:36.486
That poor blind girl has no idea
that I was even there.

52:36.570 --> 52:39.197
And because Naksu has murdered
Jin U-tak for you,

52:40.407 --> 52:41.783
there's nothing to worry about.

52:41.867 --> 52:43.743
And it's the reason you're still here.

52:46.121 --> 52:49.082
It's the reason
that you turned into a poor victim

52:49.708 --> 52:52.502
instead of being known
as a fraud who killed many

52:52.586 --> 52:55.922
and went as far as infesting themselves
a blood parasite

52:56.006 --> 52:57.966
in order to become their daughter.

53:00.343 --> 53:01.261
That is correct.

53:02.178 --> 53:05.473
- I am forever indebted to you.
- [snickers]

53:05.557 --> 53:07.392
[Jin Mu]
I know that you don't really mean that.

53:08.310 --> 53:10.645
But as long as
that parasite remains inside you,

53:10.729 --> 53:12.606
you can never leave me.

53:13.148 --> 53:14.691
Because without the medicine I give you,

53:15.483 --> 53:18.904
you would die a painful death
as your insides melt together.

53:19.696 --> 53:23.283
Regardless, both you and I
and my organization

53:23.825 --> 53:26.494
were able to escape alive,
thanks to Naksu.

53:26.578 --> 53:29.497
Although, I can't believe
how much she resembles her.

53:31.875 --> 53:32.792
What do you mean?

53:32.876 --> 53:35.962
Jin Bu-yeon is practically
Naksu's spitting image.

53:36.796 --> 53:38.465
That's why I was wary.

53:39.174 --> 53:42.677
Regardless, seeing how
that girl indeed has divine powers,

53:42.761 --> 53:46.473
she must be the real heiress
to Jinyowon after all.

53:46.556 --> 53:48.224
So that woman truly is…

53:49.809 --> 53:51.102
Jin Bu-yeon, isn't she?

54:00.278 --> 54:04.032
There was a drought
but all these flowers look so fresh.

54:04.115 --> 54:06.159
These are the flowers you loved
when we were children.

54:06.242 --> 54:08.411
[Yun-o] So I searched throughout Daeho
to find them.

54:08.495 --> 54:10.455
They're so bright and vibrant
because they're grown

54:10.538 --> 54:11.998
from the Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

54:21.216 --> 54:22.759
My old body used to be…

54:23.927 --> 54:25.428
just like this flower.

54:26.054 --> 54:29.265
As this flower is full of moisture,
it's fresh and beautiful.

54:29.766 --> 54:32.644
The flowers outside have too little energy

54:32.727 --> 54:34.354
and are rather unsightly.

54:34.437 --> 54:37.440
They're unsightly
because these flowers have no energy.

54:39.234 --> 54:40.568
They're like me.

54:46.241 --> 54:50.286
Argh! Even flowers manage to look fresh

54:50.370 --> 54:51.871
just by someone watering them!

54:52.956 --> 54:56.001
No matter how much energy I consume,

54:56.084 --> 54:58.628
my body can't stop rotting away!

54:58.712 --> 55:00.296
[breathes heavily]

55:01.673 --> 55:03.133
[Queen] Do you want me to petrify?

55:04.175 --> 55:06.219
Trapped forever in this miserable body?

55:07.137 --> 55:10.098
How dare you mock me, huh?

55:10.181 --> 55:12.017
- [angry grunt]
- [palace lady sobs]

55:13.435 --> 55:16.104
I'm so sorry, Your Highness!
Please have mercy!

55:16.771 --> 55:20.483
You, girl, are so fresh
and full of sweet vitality.

55:21.192 --> 55:23.445
- [breathes heavily]
- [palace lady whimpers]

55:25.530 --> 55:29.075
Would you dear switch bodies with me, huh?

55:31.411 --> 55:34.664
Why would you wanna switch bodies
with a mere lady away from court?

55:34.748 --> 55:36.416
- [yells]
- [Jin Mu] You are our noble Queen,

55:36.499 --> 55:37.333
after all.

55:47.719 --> 55:50.263
[Queen]
This is my cousin from Seoho Fortress.

55:51.306 --> 55:52.974
He almost married Jin Bu-yeon.

55:55.435 --> 55:56.853
I heard about what happened.

55:57.437 --> 56:00.398
Jang Uk's married into Jinyowon?

56:00.482 --> 56:01.566
And now,

56:02.484 --> 56:05.236
it'll be even more difficult
to take control of Jinyowon

56:06.112 --> 56:07.572
away from the Jin family.

56:09.657 --> 56:11.785
But the rite of the great lake?

56:11.868 --> 56:14.162
You said only a relic of Jinyowon

56:14.245 --> 56:16.456
had the power to take
the ice stone of the sky.

56:19.751 --> 56:24.297
How could we possibly open Jinyowon
if that man's there?

56:24.380 --> 56:27.300
We just need to separate
Jin Bu-yeon from Jang Uk.

56:27.383 --> 56:28.593
But they're a married couple now.

56:28.676 --> 56:31.763
Who would acknowledge her as his wife
when there wasn't even a wedding?

56:31.846 --> 56:33.098
And what's more,

56:33.181 --> 56:36.684
Jang Uk in fact has another bride
that everyone in Daeho knows about.

56:41.272 --> 56:42.107
Naksu?

56:42.190 --> 56:44.734
It'll soon be three years
ever since Naksu's death.

56:44.818 --> 56:47.320
I shall summon Naksu's soul once again.

56:47.403 --> 56:49.906
Jang Uk will be thrown into despair.

56:51.241 --> 56:52.158
Afterwards…

56:54.119 --> 56:58.540
Jin Bu-yeon can go on
and get married to her former betrothed.

56:58.623 --> 57:01.918
[dramatic music playing]

57:07.257 --> 57:09.592
[Go Won] I heard none of the mages
at the Unanimous Assembly

57:09.676 --> 57:12.011
could stop Jang Uk
from leaving the Jinyowon's priestess.

57:12.095 --> 57:14.931
Is he truly more powerful
than all of the mages at the Assembly?

57:15.014 --> 57:17.267
I heard they just let him go
because he said they're married.

57:17.350 --> 57:18.184
[scoffs]

57:18.935 --> 57:20.603
They always have
a good excuse, don't they?

57:20.687 --> 57:23.815
I heard Jin Bu-yeon wields
great divine powers.

57:23.898 --> 57:25.733
[Go Won] Did he only marry her
because of those powers?

57:25.817 --> 57:29.404
Her portrait was posted all over Daeho
and apparently, she's a great beauty.

57:30.029 --> 57:31.114
He did it for her looks?

57:31.197 --> 57:33.199
I know Jang Uk pretty well at this point.

57:33.283 --> 57:35.034
He would only seduce a woman
because he needs her,

57:35.118 --> 57:36.661
not because of how she looks.

57:51.634 --> 57:52.760
[Go Won] Did they fight?

57:52.844 --> 57:54.804
[Eunuch Oh] Something must have happened
to the court ladies

57:54.888 --> 57:56.431
who're serving Her Royal Highness.

57:56.514 --> 57:57.348
[sighs]

57:58.475 --> 58:00.351
It seems she's taking her anger
out on the innocent

58:00.435 --> 58:03.021
since His Majesty does
all he can to avoid her now.

58:03.104 --> 58:06.399
In fact, lately, there's been
some talk regarding the powder

58:06.483 --> 58:08.318
the Queen has given to her Ladies.

58:09.027 --> 58:09.861
Powder?

58:10.528 --> 58:12.614
Cosmetics? Like how?

58:12.697 --> 58:14.782
They say the powder that they were given

58:14.866 --> 58:17.535
seems to be cursed with sorcery
that dries out their skin.

58:18.161 --> 58:18.995
[sighs]

58:21.623 --> 58:23.458
Retrieve all the powder
that she's given to them

58:24.000 --> 58:26.461
and look into where the Queen
would get such an item like that.

58:27.462 --> 58:28.630
Yes, Sire.

58:35.637 --> 58:37.514
[merchant 1]
Hey, come look at these beautiful shoes.

58:37.597 --> 58:39.807
Gosh, what a pretty lady!
Come look at these shoes.

58:39.891 --> 58:42.018
Come here, look. They suit you perfectly.

58:42.101 --> 58:44.604
- I bet they'll look great on you.
- [customer] Wow, beautiful!

58:44.687 --> 58:45.855
- [sniffs]
- [merchant 1] Oh, yes. Thank you.

58:45.939 --> 58:47.065
Come again!

58:49.275 --> 58:50.693
[sizzling]

58:50.777 --> 58:52.779
Wow! That looks delicious.

58:54.948 --> 58:56.991
[suspenseful music playing]

59:01.329 --> 59:03.873
Oh. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

59:15.635 --> 59:17.637
[merchant 2]
Is there anything you are looking for?

59:19.764 --> 59:22.141
I heard you're selling powder
directly to the royal palace.

59:22.225 --> 59:24.269
- What? A powder?
- Yeah.

59:28.147 --> 59:29.357
I'm a eunuch from the royal palace.

59:30.775 --> 59:32.902
You must be the eunuch
she sent to collect.

59:33.444 --> 59:34.988
[merchant 2] This way, follow me.

59:45.832 --> 59:50.795
Oh, my! Interested in the rouge?
Go on! Try it on! It's so pretty.

59:50.878 --> 59:53.298
There's no need.
I'm just looking for now. Thank you.

59:54.507 --> 59:56.551
This isn't just any rouge.

59:56.634 --> 59:58.845
If you put this on your lips,

59:58.928 --> 01:00:02.140
you will have the power
to sway the hearts of men everywhere.

01:00:04.809 --> 01:00:05.643
Is that true?

01:00:06.477 --> 01:00:08.646
Are you attempting to seduce
a man you know?

01:00:10.815 --> 01:00:12.191
I have a husband.

01:00:12.900 --> 01:00:13.735
Ah…

01:00:20.158 --> 01:00:22.410
I can tell this rouge is no ordinary item.

01:00:22.493 --> 01:00:25.872
All of our products are
rather unique items.

01:00:26.706 --> 01:00:27.540
[merchant 3] Just look.

01:00:27.624 --> 01:00:29.834
Do you see that eunuch
from the royal palace?

01:00:30.710 --> 01:00:34.172
Even the members
of the royal family shop here.

01:00:34.714 --> 01:00:36.090
I'm guessing you didn't know that.

01:00:36.174 --> 01:00:37.800
The energy here doesn't feel very good.

01:00:40.720 --> 01:00:43.765
The energy flowing through this shop
is similar to Gaema Village's.

01:00:44.599 --> 01:00:47.435
Oh, are you also a shaman then?

01:00:47.518 --> 01:00:50.021
[merchant 3] I can show you
what usually peaks their interests.

01:00:50.813 --> 01:00:51.689
No, thank you.

01:00:56.444 --> 01:00:58.488
Are you selling this… this turtle too?

01:00:58.571 --> 01:01:01.783
I'm sorry but that's not for sale.
That's our special ingredient.

01:01:01.866 --> 01:01:03.034
Ingredient?

01:01:03.117 --> 01:01:06.162
[merchant 3]
The shell of a turtle is a vital resource.

01:01:06.245 --> 01:01:09.624
It's very precious.
Don't put your hands on it!

01:01:10.375 --> 01:01:12.210
- Ok-sim!
- What?

01:01:12.293 --> 01:01:14.796
An ingredient? You poor thing.

01:01:18.341 --> 01:01:21.260
Uh, excuse me, Mr. Eunuch,
do you have money?

01:01:24.430 --> 01:01:25.723
Me?

01:01:26.432 --> 01:01:29.060
- Were you just talking to me?
- If you have some, buy this turtle then.

01:01:29.977 --> 01:01:31.562
I can tell it has very good energy.

01:01:31.646 --> 01:01:33.106
If you keep it, it'll bring you luck.

01:01:34.816 --> 01:01:37.110
Do shamans read turtles' fortune as well?

01:01:37.193 --> 01:01:38.736
[Go Won] Why should I keep it?

01:01:38.820 --> 01:01:42.198
It will be killed if it remains here
much longer. Take pity on him.

01:01:42.281 --> 01:01:44.659
Forget it. If you pity it,
you should purchase it. Why would I?

01:01:44.742 --> 01:01:46.369
It's just I have no way to pay.

01:01:46.452 --> 01:01:48.121
And I'm living at someone else's home,

01:01:48.204 --> 01:01:49.914
so I wouldn't dare
to take it in, you know.

01:01:52.083 --> 01:01:53.000
[Bu-yeon] Oh, how sweet!

01:01:53.543 --> 01:01:55.753
Look how it's stretching its neck
to look up at you.

01:01:55.837 --> 01:01:57.004
Will you just let it die here?

01:02:01.843 --> 01:02:04.262
All turtles look like that.
It's… it's not stretching

01:02:04.345 --> 01:02:05.930
just to… just to look up at me.

01:02:07.682 --> 01:02:09.767
Take it and raise it! I mean…

01:02:10.309 --> 01:02:12.520
if you are a eunuch,
you can't have children anyways.

01:02:13.604 --> 01:02:15.148
It will be very rewarding for you.

01:02:15.815 --> 01:02:18.025
Children?
[chuckles awkwardly]

01:02:19.026 --> 01:02:20.153
Listen, shaman.

01:02:20.236 --> 01:02:22.697
If you're this bad at reading,
it's no wonder you're broke.

01:02:22.780 --> 01:02:24.949
Do I look like the kind of guy
who would raise a turtle as his own?

01:02:25.533 --> 01:02:28.119
I'm not able to read faces,
but I can see energy.

01:02:28.202 --> 01:02:30.246
Although you may speak coldly towards me,

01:02:31.080 --> 01:02:34.083
your eyes reflect a warm heart
that wants to save this turtle.

01:02:37.879 --> 01:02:39.505
You have a very unique energy too.

01:02:40.423 --> 01:02:41.549
Maybe the palace gives it to you.

01:02:43.718 --> 01:02:45.678
Yes, I am…

01:02:47.638 --> 01:02:48.806
a member of the Go family.

01:02:54.520 --> 01:02:57.815
Okay then, Eunuch Go,
take good care of this turtle.

01:02:58.941 --> 01:03:00.902
[quirky music playing]

01:03:06.240 --> 01:03:07.992
By saying I was a member of the Go family,

01:03:08.075 --> 01:03:09.786
I told her I was royalty.

01:03:11.078 --> 01:03:12.663
How could she not know?

01:03:12.747 --> 01:03:14.207
Is she dumb?

01:03:18.377 --> 01:03:19.420
Your Highness.

01:03:20.129 --> 01:03:21.714
[Eunuch Oh] It was the same powder.

01:03:26.219 --> 01:03:30.014
The well was just fine, but in a few days,
it just suddenly dried up.

01:03:30.097 --> 01:03:32.767
Cheonbugwan was called to investigate
what was going on,

01:03:32.850 --> 01:03:34.936
but they have yet
to lift their hand to help.

01:03:35.019 --> 01:03:36.896
This drought's gone on for a while,

01:03:36.979 --> 01:03:39.148
but no well could have dried up
in a few days like this.

01:03:42.568 --> 01:03:44.153
[woman]
Why did you bring someone like him here?

01:03:44.987 --> 01:03:47.323
Why didn't you bring
a powerful mage instead?

01:03:47.406 --> 01:03:50.451
Hey, he said he'd look into it
if I paid for his dinner.

01:03:50.535 --> 01:03:52.119
- How could I know he would be like this?
- [woman] Gosh!

01:03:54.121 --> 01:03:56.541
[suspenseful music playing]

01:04:13.474 --> 01:04:15.351
[water sloshing]

01:04:15.434 --> 01:04:17.353
[man] Oh, my! Oh! The well is filling up.

01:04:17.436 --> 01:04:18.980
Oh! What a relief!

01:04:19.063 --> 01:04:21.065
- Oh! Oh, thank you so much!
- [man laughing]

01:04:21.148 --> 01:04:22.233
[woman] I can't believe it!

01:04:22.316 --> 01:04:25.236
I've already found similar things
in five other wells so far.

01:04:25.319 --> 01:04:26.612
[villagers] Thank you so much!

01:04:27.572 --> 01:04:29.365
Who could be behind all of this?

01:04:33.911 --> 01:04:35.913
It's no celebration without noodles.

01:04:38.791 --> 01:04:40.251
[Jin chuckles]
You moron!

01:04:40.334 --> 01:04:42.461
Had you two had a proper wedding ceremony,

01:04:42.545 --> 01:04:45.882
you'd have had the chance to serve
all guests a helping of my noodles.

01:04:47.758 --> 01:04:48.593
[Jin chuckles softly]

01:04:53.222 --> 01:04:54.056
[Jang Uk sniffs]

01:05:03.107 --> 01:05:05.776
I would never serve this to anyone.

01:05:05.860 --> 01:05:08.029
If you serve this at your wedding
to Maidservant Kim, I…

01:05:08.988 --> 01:05:09.906
I'll be very upset.

01:05:13.326 --> 01:05:14.160
Fine, I hear you.

01:05:18.289 --> 01:05:19.957
Do you think marrying Maid Kim off to me…

01:05:21.334 --> 01:05:22.209
would…

01:05:23.294 --> 01:05:25.671
mean you could just run off to die alone?

01:05:30.718 --> 01:05:33.179
Your new bride seems
to be unaware of this.

01:05:33.262 --> 01:05:34.847
How come you haven't told her yet?

01:05:34.931 --> 01:05:36.682
She's still missing her divine powers.

01:05:37.308 --> 01:05:40.478
When her memories return,
she says her powers will as well.

01:05:40.561 --> 01:05:41.520
And I've confirmed that.

01:05:43.189 --> 01:05:44.899
Then it won't happen anytime soon.

01:05:47.401 --> 01:05:48.235
Eat your noodles.

01:05:52.490 --> 01:05:54.909
These noodles, by the way,
I'm certain will kill me.

01:05:54.992 --> 01:05:58.537
[Jin] Really? But I used the exact recipe
they taught me down in the kitchens.

01:05:59.080 --> 01:06:03.376
I guess Mu-deok used to enjoy
making those noodles.

01:06:05.920 --> 01:06:08.214
I have, since now, avoided saying her name

01:06:08.297 --> 01:06:10.424
because I had no desire to hurt you.

01:06:11.926 --> 01:06:12.760
But I…

01:06:13.844 --> 01:06:16.097
I think by not saying,
it never allowed you to heal.

01:06:18.099 --> 01:06:18.975
[chopsticks clank]

01:06:20.601 --> 01:06:21.435
You…

01:06:22.937 --> 01:06:25.147
have yet to visit the cliff
where she died, right?

01:06:25.940 --> 01:06:29.402
[Jin] So why did you build
that stone tower so deep in the forest?

01:06:29.485 --> 01:06:31.320
Was it not made to commemorate her death

01:06:31.404 --> 01:06:33.239
but rather as hope she'd return?

01:06:38.452 --> 01:06:39.328
Sang-ho…

01:06:41.914 --> 01:06:45.835
witnessed her petrified before she fell
into Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:06:49.046 --> 01:06:50.548
He'll tell you what he saw.

01:06:51.632 --> 01:06:52.675
Hear it for yourself.

01:06:54.719 --> 01:06:56.012
And then mourn for her.

01:06:56.887 --> 01:07:00.349
And if you still want to die after that…

01:07:05.021 --> 01:07:05.980
come back here.

01:07:07.898 --> 01:07:09.275
I will cook something for you…

01:07:10.735 --> 01:07:12.111
other than these noodles here.

01:07:13.654 --> 01:07:16.073
[sorrowful music playing]

01:07:17.074 --> 01:07:18.617
[Jin slurps]

01:08:03.621 --> 01:08:05.456
["Blue Flower" by LIA playing]

01:08:06.248 --> 01:08:07.333
He's still not here.

01:08:12.088 --> 01:08:13.380
- [door opens]
- [gasps]

01:08:16.550 --> 01:08:17.718
- Jang Uk.
- [gasps]

01:08:18.677 --> 01:08:19.804
Ah, goodness me.

01:08:21.222 --> 01:08:25.434
Young Master Jang is often away for days
on end without saying where he's going.

01:08:26.227 --> 01:08:28.062
[Mr. Lee] You shouldn't await for him,
just go to bed.

01:08:47.581 --> 01:08:48.499
[sighs]

01:08:50.042 --> 01:08:51.627
He still hasn't come home yet.

01:08:52.378 --> 01:08:53.420
When is he coming back?

01:08:54.964 --> 01:08:55.798
[sighs]

01:09:01.512 --> 01:09:04.056
I wanted to say thanks
for destroying the tracking thread.

01:09:11.772 --> 01:09:14.066
I'm sure he'll be delighted
when I tell him I regained…

01:09:16.318 --> 01:09:17.778
another memory of mine.

01:09:18.487 --> 01:09:21.907
["Blue Flower" by Lia continues playing]

01:09:25.578 --> 01:09:26.787
[sighs]

01:09:40.718 --> 01:09:43.470
[Mu-deok] Just wait there.
I'll be there soon too.

01:09:43.971 --> 01:09:45.556
Make your next promise…

01:09:46.765 --> 01:09:48.184
to me right now, Young Master.

01:09:48.767 --> 01:09:49.935
[Jang Uk] You're the only one

01:09:50.019 --> 01:09:52.104
that I'll be wearing
for the rest of my life.

01:09:52.188 --> 01:09:54.190
[Mu-deok]
If it's a life or death situation,

01:09:54.273 --> 01:09:56.275
give up love and live.

01:09:57.401 --> 01:09:58.736
This is an order from your master.

01:10:16.003 --> 01:10:17.046
[sighs]

01:10:18.130 --> 01:10:19.381
[maid] Are you all finished eating?

01:10:28.390 --> 01:10:30.434
Why hasn't Jang Uk come home yet?

01:10:31.560 --> 01:10:32.603
My lady.

01:10:33.187 --> 01:10:34.355
[Mr. Lee]
You've been summoned to the study.

01:10:35.022 --> 01:10:36.523
[gasps]
Really?

01:10:38.525 --> 01:10:40.152
How many days have gone by?

01:10:40.236 --> 01:10:43.614
Uh… but it's not… young master.

01:10:49.954 --> 01:10:50.788
You're not him.

01:10:53.332 --> 01:10:54.250
[Maid Kim] Young Lady.

01:10:54.750 --> 01:10:57.211
Young Master Jang decides to stay
at Jeongjingak.

01:10:58.504 --> 01:11:00.547
I guess no one told you where he'd be.

01:11:01.131 --> 01:11:02.424
You must have been worried.

01:11:02.508 --> 01:11:06.720
He's been staying there ever since
you visited Songrim to introduce yourself.

01:11:06.804 --> 01:11:09.223
So then, you two
must not have been together since.

01:11:09.306 --> 01:11:12.351
No one can take care of him
since it's empty.

01:11:12.935 --> 01:11:14.478
Why is he there on his own?

01:11:14.561 --> 01:11:16.355
Maybe someone at home
makes him uncomfortable.

01:11:21.944 --> 01:11:23.070
Young Lady,

01:11:23.153 --> 01:11:25.781
let's pack for the young master
and go visit him there.

01:11:25.864 --> 01:11:27.866
I'm sure he's there
because it's comfortable.

01:11:28.492 --> 01:11:29.535
If you ever see him,

01:11:30.869 --> 01:11:33.205
please let him know
that I am well and comfortable here…

01:11:34.915 --> 01:11:36.500
just as much as he is over there.

01:11:37.459 --> 01:11:38.294
[chuckles softly]

01:11:48.345 --> 01:11:51.390
Please, if there's anything
you'd like to give him, I can take it.

01:11:51.473 --> 01:11:52.850
I will give it to him there.

01:11:52.933 --> 01:11:55.728
Why would I ask you to do
such a thing, Young Lady Heo,

01:11:56.687 --> 01:11:58.939
when his betrothed,
Young Lady Bu-yeon is here now.

01:12:00.649 --> 01:12:03.694
You need not to worry about him anymore.

01:12:06.322 --> 01:12:07.531
Oh, yeah.

01:12:12.119 --> 01:12:14.246
So why hasn't he been coming home?

01:12:15.998 --> 01:12:17.333
Is it really because of me?

01:12:18.042 --> 01:12:19.543
[Bu-yeon] Let's go now, my husband.

01:12:19.626 --> 01:12:21.378
[Jang Uk] I was telling you
to take off that cumbersome robe.

01:12:21.462 --> 01:12:22.588
You think I was asking that?

01:12:23.172 --> 01:12:26.050
If you drink that, it means
we are officially married, all right?

01:12:27.092 --> 01:12:28.552
[Bu-yeon] I do not wish to go back.

01:12:28.635 --> 01:12:31.305
I like it here. And I like you.

01:12:32.639 --> 01:12:33.515
[gasps]

01:12:35.392 --> 01:12:37.770
He's probably scared
I'll throw myself at him again.

01:12:39.104 --> 01:12:41.357
Ugh, then he'll hate it if I went to him.

01:12:41.440 --> 01:12:44.360
If you regain your memories like this,
your divine powers will return.

01:12:44.443 --> 01:12:45.944
I'm glad I brought you with me.

01:12:47.404 --> 01:12:49.323
If I go and tell him
I remembered something,

01:12:50.157 --> 01:12:51.450
he would like that though, right?

01:12:56.413 --> 01:12:57.247
Maidservant Kim.

01:12:58.999 --> 01:13:00.417
I must go and see him now.

01:13:01.502 --> 01:13:03.170
Could you please
pack his belongings for me?

01:13:03.837 --> 01:13:05.714
[exciting music playing]

01:13:09.843 --> 01:13:10.677
[Bu-yeon] My lady.

01:13:11.720 --> 01:13:12.805
Let me come with.

01:13:13.972 --> 01:13:15.766
I simply can't wait
to see Jang Uk anymore.

01:13:15.849 --> 01:13:17.810
It seems like he was avoiding you.

01:13:17.893 --> 01:13:19.311
What if he's unhappy to see you?

01:13:19.978 --> 01:13:22.064
[Bu-yeon] I never said I was hoping
he'd be pleased to see me.

01:13:22.648 --> 01:13:26.610
I said that I simply could not wait
to see him anymore, did I not?

01:13:26.693 --> 01:13:30.030
But Sun-i, it seems you're hoping
he won't be pleased to see me.

01:13:30.906 --> 01:13:31.740
Why?

01:13:33.367 --> 01:13:34.993
Because that's what your young lady wants?

01:13:36.912 --> 01:13:39.832
- My… My young lady was the first to--
- You seem to have a misunderstanding.

01:13:40.541 --> 01:13:42.835
I am worried about you, not jealous.

01:13:43.585 --> 01:13:47.256
I doubt he'll be pleased to see you,
either you or me.

01:13:49.675 --> 01:13:51.176
I can't really tell if you're being humble

01:13:51.260 --> 01:13:53.137
or condescending
by thinking we are the same?

01:13:53.220 --> 01:13:54.638
I was trying to advise you.

01:13:55.389 --> 01:13:57.057
Never mind if you don't understand.

01:14:03.188 --> 01:14:05.482
What is that in your hand?

01:14:08.444 --> 01:14:09.278
Have you seen this?

01:14:09.361 --> 01:14:10.195
That is…

01:14:11.113 --> 01:14:12.406
known as the yin-yang jade.

01:14:12.489 --> 01:14:13.407
A what?

01:14:14.116 --> 01:14:15.951
[Yun-ok]
There's a red jade and a blue jade.

01:14:16.618 --> 01:14:18.954
The pair calls to each other. How did…

01:14:20.497 --> 01:14:22.207
How come you have it now?

01:14:22.291 --> 01:14:23.208
I found it.

01:14:24.460 --> 01:14:26.712
I took it with me
after the owner's stone tower fell.

01:14:27.296 --> 01:14:28.172
I'll return it soon.

01:14:28.255 --> 01:14:29.631
What do you mean by that?

01:14:29.715 --> 01:14:32.050
The owner of that blue jade is dead.

01:14:33.635 --> 01:14:34.720
[Yun-ok] Her name was Naksu.

01:14:35.512 --> 01:14:37.931
She was the one
who stabbed him in the chest.

01:14:38.015 --> 01:14:39.183
Naksu?

01:14:41.018 --> 01:14:42.269
I've heard that name.

01:14:43.061 --> 01:14:44.188
She was Jang Uk's enemy.

01:14:46.231 --> 01:14:48.901
You really don't know then, do you?

01:14:53.947 --> 01:14:56.241
Try giving it energy and call for him.

01:14:57.117 --> 01:14:58.494
Then you'll understand it all.

01:14:58.577 --> 01:15:02.164
See for yourself the reason
why no one believed you were…

01:15:03.916 --> 01:15:04.750
his bride.

01:15:07.002 --> 01:15:09.087
[pensive music playing]

01:15:28.440 --> 01:15:29.316
[exhales deeply]

01:15:38.367 --> 01:15:40.494
You don't even know him,
yet you followed him here.

01:15:40.577 --> 01:15:43.163
He would never think
of getting married ever again.

01:15:43.247 --> 01:15:47.209
Is it really true
that you and Uk are married?

01:15:47.292 --> 01:15:48.752
This is why she came here to meet us.

01:15:48.835 --> 01:15:51.296
She's having a hard time
coming to terms with you marrying Uk.

01:15:51.380 --> 01:15:53.715
To be honest, it's hard for me too.

01:15:53.799 --> 01:15:55.592
So you really didn't know
about any of this?

01:15:55.676 --> 01:15:58.887
See for yourself the reason
why no one believed you were…

01:15:58.971 --> 01:16:00.013
his bride.

01:16:07.104 --> 01:16:07.938
[Maid Kim] Young Master.

01:16:08.772 --> 01:16:09.982
Did you just get here?

01:16:10.065 --> 01:16:11.608
Yes, would you draw a bath,
Maidservant Kim?

01:16:11.692 --> 01:16:13.110
What about Young Lady Bu-yeon?

01:16:14.820 --> 01:16:17.698
Did you not see the girl?
She said she was going to see you.

01:16:17.781 --> 01:16:19.992
She even packed
some honey biscuits to bring you.

01:16:21.994 --> 01:16:23.370
- You must have missed each other.
- [sighs]

01:16:23.954 --> 01:16:25.414
She seemed to be really worried

01:16:25.497 --> 01:16:27.457
because she had no idea
where you could be.

01:16:38.510 --> 01:16:40.429
[Maid Kim]
She's probably out there looking for you.

01:16:41.722 --> 01:16:42.639
[sighs]

01:16:46.435 --> 01:16:47.853
[chimes]

01:17:07.039 --> 01:17:09.082
["I'm Sorry" by Ailee playing]

01:17:13.837 --> 01:17:15.839
[panting]

01:18:13.605 --> 01:18:17.192
I regained another memory,
and now I can do this.

01:18:19.695 --> 01:18:20.696
Was it you who called me?

01:18:22.197 --> 01:18:23.824
I heard they were a pair so I tried it.

01:18:25.575 --> 01:18:28.495
[tense music playing]

01:18:30.664 --> 01:18:31.957
I was the one who called you.

01:18:32.791 --> 01:18:33.959
But I guess I'm not the one…

01:18:36.294 --> 01:18:37.295
you came here to find.

01:18:41.383 --> 01:18:43.051
I frantically rushed over here.

01:18:44.344 --> 01:18:45.971
You better have a good reason for this.

01:18:46.054 --> 01:18:47.889
If I tell you something
you wanted to hear,

01:18:49.099 --> 01:18:50.058
will that be enough?

01:18:54.438 --> 01:18:56.064
I regained another memory today.

01:19:00.152 --> 01:19:01.695
For a very long time now…

01:19:04.990 --> 01:19:06.366
you and I have liked each other.

01:19:13.498 --> 01:19:17.127
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the Garden playing]

01:19:51.077 --> 01:19:53.997
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:19:54.080 --> 01:19:56.833
[Sang-ho] A lot of people were massacred
on the boat at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:19:56.917 --> 01:19:58.251
They say it was Naksu's doing.

01:19:58.335 --> 01:20:01.505
The soul shifter that has appeared now,
Naksu is the one.

01:20:01.588 --> 01:20:03.840
Since you're concerned about this,
I'll get rid of her myself.

01:20:03.924 --> 01:20:05.550
[Go Won] How do you expect him
to get rid of something

01:20:05.634 --> 01:20:06.593
that doesn't exist?

01:20:06.676 --> 01:20:10.013
These ridiculous rumors
could end up killing your daughter.

01:20:10.096 --> 01:20:12.599
By the way,
are you very ill by any chance?

01:20:12.682 --> 01:20:14.142
What do I have inside my body?

01:20:14.226 --> 01:20:16.728
[Queen] I thought of holding a banquet
outside the palace.

01:20:16.812 --> 01:20:19.898
[Go Won] If Jin Bu-yeon does get attacked,
it will be Naksu's doing.

01:20:19.981 --> 01:20:22.692
And Jang Uk will have to take the blame
for all of it.
